&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=40efddd5ca057c7813ee9171f04286f6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/af174e3c/uploads/origins/fcc58282-4afd-4896-8b5a-99cb48a1fbed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=700518c1171e81543736eddbdbc361d7 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "初めまして！とても素敵な絵を描かれているにでリクエストを送らせていただきました！\n\n描いて欲しいのは私のD&Dキャラクターのスウシくんです。彼はゴライアスっという種族で肌の色が少し灰色い感じで少し黒めのアザのような模様があります。\n服の花のような模様はマリーゴールドをイメージしています。\n\n普段は優しく穏やかな性格だが、少しイジワルな一面も。\n\nポーズと表情はお任せします。目は糸目でも少し開いているのでも構いません。\n\nありがとうございます。\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/12576746.souci/45278223\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/12576746.souci/45477757", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@rumnobl/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/42cb0fdc/uploads/origins/9ac4e2dc-56b2-435f-ba53-626d99f824bf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9bcaa23227784126127f0d1ce5becead", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/42cb0fdc/uploads/origins/9ac4e2dc-56b2-435f-ba53-626d99f824bf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9bcaa23227784126127f0d1ce5becead, https://si.imgix.net/42cb0fdc/uploads/origins/9ac4e2dc-56b2-435f-ba53-626d99f824bf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b5cba15f500b2b87ee213e9cead8d09a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/42cb0fdc/uploads/origins/9ac4e2dc-56b2-435f-ba53-626d99f824bf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3348d7fcf33105994011432a92084fa9 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi RUM! I saw your art and I really love the style! \nI'd love to see you draw my goblin vtuber character! \nMy name is \"Glowbi\" and I have a new design coming out soon.\n\nI'm happy for you to decide on the pose\nyou can see my reference here: \nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Te9U-IWvf_4Aq7IJ8Y2qaTY6IbZ-5KYe?usp=sharing\n\nI've also included his mascot friend and mascot just so you get a better idea of the character.", "c